    "subtitle": "Choosing what fits · 1 · preparation 1",
    "context": "Use this subset of the shopping vocabulary and constructions in a short self-contained situation, preparing for U3-06. Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to compare quantity, suitability and price before making a purchase.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-06-P01-interact-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Explain the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U3-06-P01-interact-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "Choosing what fits · 1 · preparation 1: Explain the practical problem and your proposed response to an absent partner. State one constraint or condition and explain how it changes the plan.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "我和朋友在家里找出门要穿的衣服。椅子上有一条裤子，旁边有一件大衣。朋友以为两件都是我的，问我为什么准备这么多。\n\n我说：“裤子是我的，大衣是爸爸的。他要去公司，我只去学校。”朋友拿着那条裤子，又问我这条是不是爸爸的。他觉得裤子很长，不明白我为什么说是自己的。\n\n爸爸走来，把大衣穿上，说：“我的在这儿。裤子是他的，大了一点儿。”我把裤子穿给朋友看，有点儿大，也能穿。\n\n朋友说：“我不能看衣服大，就觉得一定是爸爸的。”爸爸穿着大衣等我，我把他的书给了他，再拿着自己的书包去学校。朋友这次没有再问衣服是谁的。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My problem and proposed response follow the source."
              },
